INTERNAL COMPANY KNOWLEDGE ASSISTANT

It's internal company AI that help employee to understand document of the company, just like Employee Guidelines, or Onboarding Document For Employee.
It will help Human Resource to explain to new employee.

Production-Ready RAG System

1. Technology Stack
🖥 Frontend
- Streamlit
- Chat UI
- File upload
- PDF viewer (iframe)
- Highlight trigger (“Read More”)

2. Document Processing

- LangChain Document schema
- Custom:
  loader.py → load PDF/TXT/MD
  chunker.py → Section-based semantic chunking
  Regex-based structure detection
- TOC extraction
- Header & version history skipping

3. Chunking Strategy
- Section-Based Semantic Chunking
- Section based chunking
- Skip:
   Cover
   Table of Contents
   Version History
   Repeated page header

4. Vector Store
Qdrant (Self-hosted)

Used as:
- Persistent vector database
- Metadata filtering
- Production-grade similarity search

Configuration:
Distance: Cosine
Embedding model: sentence-transformers/all-MiniLM-L6-v2
Metadata filtering: workspace_id

5. RAG Chain
Mode: Compliance Mode (No hallucination)
LLM:
  Optional (Ollama local)
  Not required for summary
  Deterministic formatting

6. System Flow Diagram:

User Upload PDF
        ↓
Document Loader
        ↓
Section-Based Chunker
        ↓
Metadata Enrichment
        ↓
Embedding Generation
        ↓
Qdrant Vector Store
        ↓
--------------------------------
User Ask Question
        ↓
Similarity Search (Qdrant)
        ↓
Custom Re-rank (Title + Density)
        ↓
Best Section Selected
        ↓
Compliance Formatter
        ↓
Answer + Bullet Points
        ↓
(If Click Read More)
        ↓
Precise PDF Highlight
        ↓
Display Page

Running the App
1. Install Dependencies/Library

pip install -r requirements.txt

2. Run Qdrant
docker run -p 6333:6333 qdrant/qdrant

3️⃣ Set Config

config.py

QDRANT_URL = "http://localhost:6333"
QDRANT_COLLECTION = "company_knowledge"

Running the System
streamlit run app.py

Open:

http://localhost:8501


4. Create folder ./uploads/ on root directory

Set Config

Example file:
Small_Business_Administration_Employee_polich_Template.pdf